  "text": "Offers\nHorses\nTack\nTack boutique\nTack Summoning Stall\n🐎 Tack\nCatalog\nRider\nRanches\nStore\nMore\nMarket / Tack\nTack locker\n13 items\n\nEquip your horses for the trail ahead.\n\n🗝️\nSilver Keys: 0\nA key opens a tack chest: one piece, rarity rolled (Common 52% · Uncommon 28% · Rare 13% · Epic 5.5% · Legendary 1.5%). Keys come from events, taming, breeding, the Trail Pass and trophies. Tack also comes from the market stall below, world chests, Grandma's tack room, Bo's missions and the top rung of the weekly ⭐ Star Points ladder.\nOpen chest 🗝️\n🎁 Weekly key\nDressing\nRiding · Bramble\nAt grass · Clover\nany horse — in the barn, at grass or at a post\n🧰\nBo's Saddlery\nToolkits I·II·III: 0 · 0 · 0 — an upgrade needs one (I up to Lv 3, II to Lv 6, III to Lv 8). 🔧 Parts: 0 from stripped spares. Bigger kits drop from chests and quests.\nKit I · 180🪙\nKit II · 420🪙 + 10 parts\nKit III · 900🪙 + 30 parts\n🎁 Weekly kit\n🤝\nCottonwood market · today's tack\n🎁\nEnduring Trail Saddle\nUncommon · +2 Stamina\n225🪙\n🎁\nQuick Homestead Pad\nCommon · +1 Acceleration\n100🪙\n🎁\nLeaping Silver Bridle of Stamina\nRare · +3 Jump, +1 Stamina · Silver set\n500🪙\nBramble · equipped stats\nStat\tBase\tTack\tTotal\nSpeed\t4\t+0\t4\nStamina\t4\t+1\t5\nJump\t4\t+0\t4\nAcceleration\t4\t+0\t4\nAgility\t3\t+0\t3\nTack includes matching-set bonuses. Equipped totals count toward event stat requirements. Speed, acceleration and agility improve pace and handling; jump improves clearance, and stamina helps you last longer. Horse levels and ribbons are earned by playing.\n🎁\nGrandma's Old Saddle\nCommon · Lv 1/8 · +1 Stamina · worn\nNext level: +0.5 Stamina\nTake off\n⬆ 120🪙 + 🧰1\n🔀 250🪙\n🎁\n🟦 Saddle Pad\nBasic equipment · no stat bonus\nOrder plain · 150🪙\n🎁\n🪢 Bridle\nBasic equipment · no stat bonus\nOrder plain · 150🪙\n🎁\n🍀 Horseshoes\nnothing yet\nOrder plain · 150🪙\nLocker · 4 spare pieces · Common +1 · Uncommon +2 · Rare +3/+1 · Epic +4/+4 · Legendary +5/+5/+2\n🎁\nLeaping Silver Pad of Stamina\nRare · Lv 1/8 · +1 Stamina, +3 Jump · Silver set\nNext level: +0.25 Stamina, +0.5 Jump\nEquipping: Stamina +1, Jump +3 (includes set changes)\nPut on\n⬆ 264🪙 + 🧰1\n🔀 650🪙\n🔧 8 parts\n200🪙\n🎁\n🤠 Leaping Silver Bridle of Stamina\nRare · Lv 1/8 · +1 Stamina, +3 Jump · Silver set\nNext level: +0.25 Stamina, +0.5 Jump\nEquipping: Stamina +1, Jump +3 (includes set changes)\nPut on\n⬆ 264🪙 + 🧰1\n🔀 650🪙\n🔧 8 parts\n200🪙\n🎁\nLeaping Silver Shoes of Stamina\nRare · Lv 1/8 · +1 Stamina, +3 Jump · Silver set\nNext level: +0.25 Stamina, +0.5 Jump\nEquipping: Stamina +1, Jump +3 (includes set changes)\nPut on\n⬆ 264🪙 + 🧰1\n🔀 650🪙\n🔧 8 parts\n200🪙\n🎁\nLeaping Silver Saddle of Stamina\nRare · Lv 1/8 · +1 Stamina, +3 Jump · Silver set\nNext level: +0.25 Stamina, +0.5 Jump\nEquipping: Jump +3 (includes set changes)\nPut on\n⬆ 264🪙 + 🧰1\n🔀 650🪙\n🔧 8 parts\n200🪙\n✨\nTack sets · 11 Legendary, 10 Epic, 5 Rare\nEvery Rare or better piece belongs to a set named in its title — wear 2 for a bonus and all 4 for more. Legendary: Kestrel, Aurora, Meadowlark, Champion, Loon, Coyote, Falls, Sunrise, Comet, Wildfire, Moonlit. Epic: Starlit, Storm, Canyon, Hollowpeak, Ember, Thistle, Harvest, Bluebell, Ranger, Lantern. Rare: Cottonwood, Twilight, Basin, Silver, Prairie.\n🐎\nSaddle style · the worn saddle decides; this is the fallback\n🏇 English\n🤠 Western\nnow: 🏇 English — rises to the trot\n🎨\nSaddle paint · 150\n🪙\n Scarlet\n Lake Blue\n Royal Plum\n Meadow Green\n Sunshine",
